Originality
-----------
CuteClown is an original, clean-room implementation. Its source code,
styles, documentation, and public APIs are written from scratch and are
not copied, ported, translated, or closely paraphrased from other UI,
headless, motion, or charting libraries.

Public concepts (for example WAI-ARIA authoring patterns, CSS custom
properties, cascade layers, damped-spring mathematics, and published
algorithms) may be used, but must be implemented independently.

This NOTICE does not grant any rights beyond those in the Apache License
2.0 and does not list third-party runtime dependencies; core packages
are intended to ship with zero runtime dependencies.
